\section{Testing}

Tests are distributed throughout this chapter, appearing after the
implementation they verify.
All of them control time through the module's [[_now]] and [[_sleep]]
seams (\cref{sec:ratelimit-time}), so no test ever sleeps for real or
depends on the wall clock.
The [[clean_registry]] fixture complements the global [[isolate_cache]]
fixture (\cref{sec:cache-testing}): the latter gives every test a private
[[SCHOLAR_DATA_DIR]], but the limiter registry and its per-process
warning flags live in module memory and must be cleared separately.

